  "description": "MultiPlatform component (Windows, MacOs, iOS, Android, Linux, ...) to be used with package Rainbow.CSharp.SDK.\n\n\t\tIt provides optional services / tools:\n\t\t- Avatars service: to download (and stored) automatically Contacts or Bubbles avatars\n\t\t- Files service: to automatically download file thumbnail's and small files shared in Rainbow\n\t\t- Languages service: to support multi-language\n\t\t- ImageTools: to get more than 500 SVG and to manipulat image files (rotate, modify size, ...)",
